1
00:00:00,464 --> 00:00:03,424
(Penny:)Why don't I pour it in your lap
and you can tell me?

2
00:00:04,385 --> 00:00:07,095
(Sheldon:)You don't have to be mean. I'm sick.

3
00:00:07,263 --> 00:00:11,053
(Penny:)-Yeah, well, I'm sick too.
-Not my problem.

4
00:00:12,476 --> 00:00:14,566
I don't understand
how this happened to me.

5
00:00:14,896 --> 00:00:18,936
(Sheldon:)I'm scrupulous about my hygiene,
I regularly disinfect my hands...

6
00:00:19,108 --> 00:00:23,238
(Sheldon:)...and I avoid contact with other people
on general principle.

7
00:00:23,613 --> 00:00:25,613
(Penny:)I don't know what to tell you,
Sheldon.

8
00:00:28,284 --> 00:00:31,034
SHELDON:
Oh, Penny, thank you.

9
00:00:31,996 --> 00:00:33,996
(Penny:)You're welcome.

10
00:00:40,046 --> 00:00:43,546
It's you. I touched you.

11
00:00:43,799 --> 00:00:46,139
(Penny:)Happy Valentine's Day.

12
00:00:56,270 --> 00:00:58,900
(Raj:)Oh, my goodness, look at this room.

13
00:00:59,065 --> 00:01:00,105
[GASPS]

14
00:01:00,274 --> 00:01:05,984
Champagne, roses,
oh, and little chocolates.

15
00:01:06,155 --> 00:01:09,285
(Raj:)This is going to be
the best Valentine's Day ever.

16
00:01:10,576 --> 00:01:13,496
(Leonard:)Yeah, I forgot about all this.

17
00:01:13,955 --> 00:01:15,495
(Raj:)But I never will.

